```html
<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Lead Invitation</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f7; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;'
  >
    <table
      role='presentation'
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      style='background-color:#f4f4f7; padding:24px 0;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center'>
          <table
            role='presentation'
            width='600'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            style='background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;'
          >
            <tr>
              <td style='background-color:#1a73e8; padding:24px 32px;'>
                <h1 style='color:#ffffff; font-size:20px; margin:0;'>
                  Become a Lead
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style='padding:32px;'>
                <p style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5;'>
                  Hi there!,
                </p>

                <p style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5;'>
                  We are inviting you to register your interest in serving as
                  the
                  <strong>Lead for the {{position}} position</strong>
                  at
                  <strong>{{school}}</strong>
                  for the
                  <strong>{{sessionYear}} school year</strong>.
                </p>

                <p style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5;'>
                  If you are interested in taking on this leadership role,
                  please register on the Inventors platform using the link
                  below. Registration will allow you to provide the necessary
                  information and formally express your interest in becoming a
                  Lead.
                </p>

                <p style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5;'>
                  Session start date:
                  <strong>{{sessionDate}}</strong>
                </p>

                <table
                  role='presentation'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  width='100%'
                  style='margin:32px 0 16px 0;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td align='center'>
                      <a
                        href='{{registrationLink}}'
                        style='display:inline-block; background-color:#1a73e8; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; padding:14px 28px; border-radius:6px;'
                      >
                        Register to Become a Lead
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p
                  style='font-size:14px; color:#666666; line-height:1.5; text-align:center; margin:0 0 24px 0;'
                >
                  Not interested in becoming a Lead?
                  <a
                    href='{{declineLink}}'
                    style='color:#666666; text-decoration:underline;'
                  >
                    Decline this invitation
                  </a>
                </p>

                <p style='font-size:14px; color:#666666; line-height:1.5;'>
                  If you are interested in this opportunity, please complete
                  your registration using the link above.
                </p>

                <p
                  style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5; margin-top:24px;'
                >
                  We look forward to having you join the team!
                </p>

                <p style='font-size:16px; color:#333333; line-height:1.5;'>
                  Best regards,<br />
                  Inventors
                  {{school}}
                  Administration
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style='background-color:#f4f4f7; padding:16px 32px; text-align:center;'
              >
                <p style='font-size:12px; color:#999999; margin:0;'>
                  This is an automated invitation from Inventors
                  {{school}}. Please do not reply directly to this email.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
```